cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite this repository."
title: "Lean formalization of the I3322 variational theorem and finite-dimensional nonattainment"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pauwels"
    given-names: "Jef"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jefpauwels/i3322-lean"
url: "https://github.com/jefpauwels/i3322-lean"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization proving that the finite-dimensional
  quantum supremum of the I3322 Bell expression equals the Pal--Vertesi
  variational supremum and that no finite-dimensional strategy attains it.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - quantum information
  - Bell inequalities
  - I3322
